# HOME's pictures of what is heard: the notes' stars on VOX's side, lit again by each echo; the moon sliding
# off the sun while a scene travels (the diamond ring as it leaves and comes back); the looper's satellite.
# The shots are for the eye (build/scenarios/visuals/); the expects that the screen keeps working through it.
autoplay 1
wait 1500
key w4 down
wait 300
key w4 up
key w7 down
wait 200
key w7 up
wait 150
shot stars.png
turn PRESET 1
wait 400
shot travel_ring.png
wait 1600
shot travel_crescent.png
wait 4000
shot travel_far.png
expect playing 1
wait 7000
shot arrived.png
tap REC
wait 100
expect looper 1
tapkey w2
wait 900
tapkey w5
wait 900
shot loop_rec.png
tap REC
wait 2500
expect looper 2
shot loop_play.png
tap REC
wait 600
tapkey w3
wait 600
shot loop_dub.png
tap REC
wait 1500
expect layers 2
shot loop_layers.png
